e":"Entrypoint di ","position":{"start":{"line":56,"column":1,"offset":2329},"end":{"line":56,"column":15,"offset":2343}}},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"lib.rs","position":{"start":{"line":56,"column":15,"offset":2343},"end":{"line":56,"column":23,"offset":2351}}},{"type":"text","value":" sangat mirip dengan yang kita bahas di ","position":{"start":{"line":56,"column":23,"offset":2351},"end":{"line":56,"column":63,"offset":2391}}},{"type":"link","title":null,"url":"/id/courses/introduction-to-pinocchio","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Pengantar Kursus Pinocchio","position":{"start":{"line":56,"column":64,"offset":2392},"end":{"line":56,"column":90,"offset":2418}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":56,"column":63,"offset":2391},"end":{"line":56,"column":130,"offset":2458}}},{"type":"text","value":".","position":{"start":{"line":56,"column":130,"offset":2458},"end":{"line":56,"column":131,"offset":2459}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":56,"column":1,"offset":2329},"end":{"line":56,"column":131,"offset":2459}}},{"type":"code","lang":"rust","meta":null,"value":"pub mod instructions;\r\nuse instructions::*;\r\n\r\nuse pinocchio::{\r\n    account_info::AccountInfo, program_entrypoint, program_error::ProgramError,\r\n    pubkey::Pubkey, ProgramResult,\r\n};\r\n\r\nprogram_entrypoint!(process_instruction);\r\n\r\n// 22222222222222222222222222222222222222222222\r\npub const ID: Pubkey = [\r\n    0x0f, 0x1e, 0x6b, 0x14, 0x21, 0xc0, 0x4a, 0x07, \r\n    0x04, 0x31, 0x26, 0x5c, 0x19, 0xc5, 0xbb, 0xee, \r\n    0x19, 0x92, 0xba, 0xe8, 0xaf, 0xd1, 0xcd, 0x07, \r\n    0x8e, 0xf8, 0xaf, 0x70, 0x47, 0xdc, 0x11, 0xf7, \r\n];\r\n\r\nfn process_instruction(\r\n    _program_id: &Pubkey,\r\n    accounts: &[AccountInfo],\r\n    instruction_data: &[u8],\r\n) -> ProgramResult {    \r\n    match instruction_data.split_first() {\r\n        Some((OpenVault::DISCRIMINATOR, data)) => OpenVault::try_from((data, accounts))?.process(),\r\n        Some((SplitVault::DISCRIMINATOR, data)) => SplitVault::try_from((data, accounts))?.process(),\r\n        Some((CloseVault::DISCRIMINATOR, data)) => CloseVault::try_from((data, accounts))?.process(),\r\n        _ => Err(ProgramError::InvalidInstructionData)\r\n    }\r\n}","position":{"start":{"line":58,"column":1,"offset":2463},"end":{"line":89,"column":4,"offset":3561}},"data":{"highlightId":"code-2"}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Kita tidak memerlukan pengaturan state untuk ini, jadi kita akan langsung beralih ke pembuatan instruksi kita.","position":{"start":{"line":91,"column":1,"offset":3565},"end":{"line":91,"column":111,"offset":3675}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":91,"column":1,"offset":3565},"end":{"line":91,"column":111,"offset":3675}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1,"offset":0},"end":{"line":91,"column":111,"offset":3675}}},"raw":"import { ArticleSection } from \"../../../../components/ArticleSection/ArticleSection\";\r\n\r\n# The Quantum Vault\r\n\r\n![Pinocchio Quantum Vault Challenge](/graphics/challenge-banners/pinocchio-quantum-vault.png)\r\n\r\nVault adalah blok bangunan fundamental dalam DeFi yang menyediakan cara aman bagi pengguna untuk menyimpan aset mereka.\r\n\r\nDalam tantangan ini, kita akan membangun vault yang menggunakan tanda tangan Winternitz untuk verifikasi transaksi. Ini sangat menarik karena Tanda Tangan Winternitz adalah tanda tangan post-quantum pertama yang terintegrasi di Solana.\r\n\r\n> Jika Anda belum familiar dengan Tanda Tangan Winternitz, mulailah dengan membaca [Tanda Tangan Winternitz di Solana](/id/courses/winternitz-signatures-on-solana) untuk memahami konsep inti dan kriptografi yang mendasarinya.\r\n\r\nDalam tantangan ini, kita akan memperbarui lamport vault sederhana yang kita bangun di [Tantangan Pinocchio Vault](/id/challenges/pinocchio-vault) untuk memungkinkan Tanda Tangan Winternitz sebagai metode verifikasi untuk transaksi.\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"Installation\" id=\"installation\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\nSebelum Anda memulai, pastikan Rust dan Pinocchio sudah terpasang. Kemudian, jalankan perintah berikut di terminal Anda:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# create workspace\r\ncargo new Kiloshift-pinocchio-quantum-vault --lib --edition 2021\r\ncd Kiloshift-pinocchio-quantum-vault\r\n```\r\n\r\nTambahkan `pinocchio`, `pinocchio-system`, dan `solana-nostd-sha256` dan `solana-winternitz`:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\ncargo add pinocchio pinocchio-system solana-nostd-sha256 solana-winternitz\r\n```\r\n\r\nDeklarasikan tipe crate di `Cargo.toml` untuk menghasilkan artefak deployment di `target/deploy`:\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n[lib]\r\ncrate-type = [\"lib\", \"cdylib\"]\r\n```\r\n\r\nAnda sekarang siap untuk menulis program quantum vault Anda.\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"Template\" id=\"template\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\nKali ini, kita akan membagi program menjadi modul-modul kecil yang terfokus alih-alih menempatkan semuanya di `lib.rs`. Struktur folder akan terlihat kurang lebih seperti ini:\r\n\r\n```\r\nsrc\r\n├── instructions\r\n│       ├── close.rs\r\n│       ├── open.rs\r\n│       ├── mod.rs\r\n│       └── split.rs\r\n└── lib.rs\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Catatan**: Ingat untuk mengubah ID program menjadi `22222222222222222222222222222222222222222222` karena kita menggunakan ini di balik layar untuk menguji program Anda.\r\n\r\nEntrypoint di `lib.rs` sangat mirip dengan yang kita bahas di [Pengantar Kursus Pinocchio](/id/courses/introduction-to-pinocchio).\r\n\r\n```rust\r\npub mod instructions;\r\nuse instructions::*;\r\n\r\nuse pinocchio::{\r\n    account_info::AccountInfo, program_entrypoint, program_error::ProgramError,\r\n    pubkey::Pubkey, ProgramResult,\r\n};\r\n\r\nprogram_entrypoint!(process_instruction);\r\n\r\n// 22222222222222222222222222222222222222222222\r\npub const ID: Pubkey = [\r\n    0x0f, 0x1e, 0x6b, 0x14, 0x21, 0xc0, 0x4a, 0x07, \r\n    0x04, 0x31, 0x26, 0x5c, 0x19, 0xc5, 0xbb, 0xee, \r\n    0x19, 0x92, 0xba, 0xe8, 0xaf, 0xd1, 0xcd, 0x07, \r\n    0x8e, 0xf8, 0xaf, 0x70, 0x47, 0xdc, 0x11, 0xf7, \r\n];\r\n\r\nfn process_instruction(\r\n    _program_id: &Pubkey,\r\n    accounts: &[AccountInfo],\r\n    instruction_data: &[u8],\r\n) -> ProgramResult {    \r\n    match instruction_data.split_first() {\r\n        Some((OpenVault::DISCRIMINATOR, data)) => OpenVault::try_from((data, accounts))?.process(),\r\n        Some((SplitVault::DISCRIMINATOR, data)) => SplitVault::try_from((data, accounts))?.process(),\r\n        Some((CloseVault::DISCRIMINATOR, data)) => CloseVault::try_from((data, accounts))?.process(),\r\n        _ => Err(ProgramError::InvalidInstructionData)\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nKita tidak memerlukan pengaturan state untuk ini, jadi kita akan langsung beralih ke pembuatan instruksi kita.","highlightedCode":{"code-0":{"lang":"toml","hast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"pre","properties":{"class":"shiki Kiloshift","style":"background-color:#11141a;color:#f6f6f4","tabindex":"0"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"["}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#97E1F1"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"lib"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"]"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#97E1F1"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"crate-type"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" ="}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" ["}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#DEE492"},"children":[{"type":"text","valu